===

title: rosinante_Gift_Hunt_MAKEUP_END
location: town
---

No matter how you look at it, getting him a make-up kit feels like the best option. Rosinante loves make-up, after all. Whenever he puts it on, he looks like he's having so much fun!
Not to mention he's so pretty with it on... It's a win for everyone!
Nodding to yourself, you choose the palette that you feel would suit him best and make your purchase.
You can't wait to see Rosinante's eyes light up when he opens his gift!
===

title: rosinante_Gift_Hunt_MERCH_END
location: town
---

Well. You may not like Law at all, but Rosinante obviously loves him a lot; he'll probably be elated to have something to remind him of his son! Even if it's cheesy merch.
Honestly, it's so cheesy it's actually cute; you might have to steal one of those dumb keychains for yourself...
Alright, it's decided!
As you make your purchase, you can't help but look forward to the smile Rosinante gives you when he opens his gift.
===

title: rosinante_Gift_Hunt_BABY_END
location: town
---

Considering the amount of times Rosinante impales himself on table corners or stubs his toes on any given day... The baby-proofing kit should be your best bet after all. It's practical and protects him!
Not to mention it's *funny.*
As you pay for your purchase, worry suddenly creeps up on you. Hopefully Rosinante doesn't get offended...
===

title: rosinante_Gift_Hunt_BOOK_END
location: town
---

The book should make a decent gift, right? With a name like that, it could remind him of his family during happier times...
And if not, well... Who doesn't like a book?
No one, that's who!
You finish your purchase, happy to have found your gift.
===

title: rosinante_Gift_Hunt_BIRDS_END
location: town
---

The birdies should make a decent gift, right? Remind Rosinante of his brother, during happier times. Times when one of them *wasn't* in Impel Down.
And if it doesn't work, well... They're still really cute, so it should be fine!
You finish your purchase, happy to have found your gift.
===
